					<tr>
						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#261">Noblealliance.com goes Live!</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							Our new website, www.noblealliance.com is now up and running.  In addition to the usual guild info and charter, our site will bring a smile to your face with unique additions like Tavern Tales (creative stories written by members and Fun Stuff( silly screenshots and a quiz). In a few days, the first edition of the Noble Nose, our online newspaper, will be published.  In the coming weeks we will also have a buy &amp; sell marketplace and events calendar. Many of the interactive areas ( members &amp; marketplace) are still in the developement stages, but the official Noble Alliance message board should be functioning by the end of the week.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							<br>
														<strong>By:</strong>
							<span class="name"> <a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=1891">Kandu Windwolf</a> at 8:50 PM PST - November 21st, 2001</span>
						</td>
					</tr>
					</table>
				</td>
			</tr>
