					<tr>
						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#255">Reschudleing of the Dragon Circle Event</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							With Fay and Kandu's wise wisdom, they temporarily postponed the Dragon Circle Event due to the GM events that were occurring around Halloween. We are now ready again. We need for everyone to please post (in the message board under &quot;Dragon Circle Event&quot; the day or nights and about times (with time zone), so we can reschedule this event.<br />
<br />
Thank you for your understanding and cooperation!<br />
---Maktar  (Nobel Alliance)
						</td>
