						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#240">Get Our Newsletter in Email</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							Noble Alliance members can recieve all the latest news right in their mailbox! Find out what equipment is available for sale, trade, or donation.  Share in the experiences and accomplishments of you fellow members in our Noble Alliance! To get your copy simply email the editor:<br />
Elfinself@aol.com<br />
Please put Noble Alliance in the subject line and include your character name in the body.<br />
Our newsletter will include any contributions, so don't be shy - send any submissions to the same address.
